  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciek kɛnɛ nyaŋ yiëër mi di̱i̱t",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nyuuth mi gääy naath jɔɔc nhial. Tëëkɛ ciek mi ci rɔ rony kɛ cäŋ, kä te pay ciöknikɛ, kä te wi̱cdɛ kɛ kum ciɛri da̱ŋ wäl rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn ruetdɛ, kä cuɛ wiee kɛ mäc dapä, kɛnɛ bɛ̈c ciöt gatdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nyuuth dɔ̱diɛn jɔɔc nhial. Tëëkɛ nyaŋ mi lual mi di̱i̱t, mi tekɛ wuɔ̱th da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛ tuɔ̱ŋ wäl, kɛ kuɔ̱mni kuäärä da̱ŋ bärɔw wuɔ̱thnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu juälɛ pek ciɛri in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn nhial rol, kä yorɛ kɛ piny wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n. Kä cu nyaŋ cuɔ̱ŋ nhiam ciëk in ci thia̱k kɛ dap, kɛ ɣöö bɛ gatɔ wa dapɔ roc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ dap kɛ dho̱o̱l, min bi döör diaal ruac kɛ kɛɛt yieethä. Kä cua gatdɛ naŋ nhial kä Kuoth wi̱i̱ kɔam kuäärädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek rɔ bar guäth mi te baaŋ, mi ci Kuoth ɛ rialikä kɛ kui̱dɛ, guäth in ba mi̱eth thi̱n kɛ ni̱n ti bathdɔɔr kɛl wi̱cdɛ kur rɛw, wi̱cdɛ jiɛn bäkɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Mi-ka-el kɛ nyaŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ko̱r tuɔɔk nhial. Cu Mi-ka-el kɛnɛ ja̱a̱kɛ nyiëëny kɛ nyaŋ yiëër in di̱i̱t, min cu ko̱r tɛr kɛnɛ ja̱a̱kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cua nyaŋ puɔ̱t, kä cuɛ cu thil gua̱a̱th kɛ kui̱diɛn nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua nyaŋ in di̱i̱t yuɔr piny, min la thɔ̱l ëë wal, in cɔalkɛ i̱ “Gua̱n Jiäkni”, kiɛ “Cɛy-tan”, mëë ci ɣɔw kɛɛliw mɛt. Cua jɛ yuɔr piny kɛnɛ ja̱a̱kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɔw mi di̱i̱t liŋ nhial, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci nyaŋ ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ca jɛ yuɔr piny, cuɛ riŋ kɔɔr ciëk in ci dap kɛ gat mi dho̱o̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cua ciek ka̱m gɔ̱k kuëth in di̱i̱t da̱ŋ rɛw, kɛ ɣöö derɛ rɔ bar kɛ thɔ̱l barɛ rɔ däär dɔaar, guäth in ba jɛ wä mi̱eeth thi̱n kɛ run da̱ŋ diɔ̱k kɛ nuth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu thɔ̱l pi̱ ti ce̱tkɛ kir ŋɔak kɔɔr ciëk kɛ thokdɛ, kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ lɔak dɔɔr kɛ nyɔc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu piny ciek ben luäk. Cu piny rɔ lɛp, kä cuɛ kir in ci nyaŋ kɛ ŋɔk kɛ thokdɛ math. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nyaŋ gaak kɛ ciek, cuɛ rɔ ri̱t cuɛ ko̱r wä tɛr kɛ duɔth gan ciek, nɛy tin ka̱pkɛ ŋuɔ̱t Kuɔth, kä tiɛtkɛ nën Yecu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
